  "details": "Hello VRChat ever since think about other community and speakers at the game? there is a lot of amount of Arabs playing your game such as ARAB Alpha or Arab Desert with majority of them playing your game everyday, when if anyone trying to type with arabic keyboard the arabic words goes from left to the right since our language have a big challenge that we write from right to left its something difficult to change ingame, but i hope so we see a support of this language, i looked you guys discord community having an arabic general chat section so i wonder if you guys well do something about hiring people translate the game and support arabic language and pleasure thanks!",
